- $R_2$ (at b) $= \dfrac{R_aR_c}{40} = \dfrac{200}{40} = 5$ Ω
- $R_3$ (at c) $= \dfrac{R_aR_b}{40} = \dfrac{200}{40} = 5$ Ω

